WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.372 --> 00:00:03.973
- Dad, what's gonna happen if
I put diesel fuel in my car?

00:00:03.973 --> 00:00:07.036
(playful guitar music)

00:00:07.036 --> 00:00:07.623
Dad.

00:00:07.623 --> 00:00:08.359
- Hey, Dad.

00:00:08.359 --> 00:00:10.264
- Dad, I'm at a party and
I need to plunge a toilet.

00:00:10.264 --> 00:00:12.040
- Dad, what's a dipstick?

00:00:12.040 --> 00:00:14.675
- What the hell is in
the back of a toilet?

00:00:14.675 --> 00:00:17.020
Dad, which remote turns on my TV?

00:00:17.020 --> 00:00:17.833
My lights went off.

00:00:17.833 --> 00:00:19.233
How do I turn them back on?

00:00:19.233 --> 00:00:21.223
I'm trying to watch Bachelorette.

00:00:21.223 --> 00:00:23.149
Will I get electrocuted if I touch this

00:00:23.149 --> 00:00:26.072
circuit breaker board light thing?

00:00:26.072 --> 00:00:27.446
- Hey, Dad, how many plugs

00:00:27.446 --> 00:00:30.302
can I put in an outlet
before it becomes dangerous?

00:00:30.302 --> 00:00:31.718
Can we sue him for that?

00:00:31.718 --> 00:00:33.250
- What's a Roth IRA?

00:00:33.250 --> 00:00:34.597
- Can they sue us for that?

00:00:34.597 --> 00:00:36.083
- Well, what's a 401K?

00:00:36.083 --> 00:00:38.196
- I wasn't peeing in public.

00:00:38.196 --> 00:00:39.102
- Can I have more money?

00:00:39.102 --> 00:00:40.379
- If the engine light went off by itself,

00:00:40.379 --> 00:00:41.516
does that mean it's fixed?

00:00:41.516 --> 00:00:43.629
- Dad, do we have AAA?

00:00:43.629 --> 00:00:48.201
- Dad, if I've never changed
my oil, is that a bad thing?

00:00:48.201 --> 00:00:49.179
Hey, Dad.

00:00:49.179 --> 00:00:51.558
When did you know you wanted to marry Mom?

00:00:52.958 --> 00:00:53.939
- Hey.

00:00:53.939 --> 00:00:54.728
- Hey, what's up?

00:00:54.728 --> 00:00:55.721
- What are you doing out here?

00:00:55.721 --> 00:00:56.833
- Just talking to my dad.

00:00:56.833 --> 00:00:57.621
- We're gonna be late.

00:00:57.621 --> 00:00:59.143
- Okay
- [Woman] Come on.

00:00:59.143 --> 00:01:00.513
- Hey, Dad, I gotta go.

00:01:02.027 --> 00:01:07.027
(slow cheerful guitar music)

